            ],
            "Set up. Google reviews are loaded live each time a page with a Reviews block is viewed: one Place Details request on your own key per view, never stored (Google\u2019s terms do not allow keeping them).": [
                "Qura\u015fd\u0131rma. Google r\u0259yl\u0259ri R\u0259yl\u0259r bloku olan s\u0259hif\u0259 h\u0259r d\u0259f\u0259 bax\u0131ld\u0131qda canl\u0131 olaraq y\u00fckl\u0259nir: h\u0259r bax\u0131\u015f \u00fc\u00e7\u00fcn \u00f6z a\u00e7ar\u0131n\u0131zla bir Place Details sor\u011fusu, he\u00e7 vaxt saxlan\u0131lm\u0131r (Google-un \u015f\u0259rtl\u0259ri onlar\u0131n saxlan\u0131lmas\u0131na icaz\u0259 vermir)."
